---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import headshotEthan from "../images/about/headshot-ethan.png";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Matlack Electric"
  description="Matlack Electric is a premier residential electrical contractor built for renovations — partnering with homeowners, designers, and contractors on wiring, smart home, and energy systems."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>
        Matlack Electric is fully licensed and insured, with every project built
        on quality, clean installations, and the professionalism your project
        deserves.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="about-bio">
      <Image
        src={headshotEthan}
        alt="Ethan Matlack, owner of Matlack Electric"
      />
      <div>
        <h2>Meet Ethan</h2>
        <p>
          My background is actually in Robotics Engineering - I studied at
          Widener University, graduating in 2023. As a freshman there, I
          received the School of Engineering's Ambassador Award for organizing a
          large robotics competition.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started Matlack Electric back in 2020 in Chester County,
          Pennsylvania while I was still in school. Over the years, I've grown
          from a small service-work-based operation to a full-service electrical
          contractor spanning multiple disciplines. I love working with
          homeowners, designers, and contractors to bring their vision to life,
          and I take pride in the quality of my work and the relationships I
          build with my clients. I became a licensed Master Electrician in 2023,
          the same year I graduated.
        </p>
        <p>
          In 2026, I relocated Matlack Electric to Chattanooga, Tennessee.
          However the business grows from here, I'm still the one who shows up
          on site and the one you'll be talking to from your first call through
          the final walkthrough.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="notice">
      <p>
        <strong>Local recognition:</strong> In 2021, <em>The Daily Local</em> covered
        the volunteer electrical work I did restoring power in Downingtown after
        Hurricane Ida - around 30 households back on the grid after several
        days of unpaid, 14-hour days.
      </p>
      <a
        class="btn btn-outline"
        href="https://www.dailylocal.com/2021/09/08/electrician-ethan-matlack-21-volunteers-to-help-families-restore-home-power-in-downingtown-during-wake-of-ida/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the article</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>Qualifications</h2>
      <p>
        My personal licenses, education, and safety training - see
        <a href="/partners/">Partners &amp; Certifications</a> for the manufacturer-specific
        training Matlack Electric holds.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>TN LLE License</h3>
        <p>
          Licensed statewide in TN as a Limited Licensed Electrician (LLE) since
          2026. License #64372, <a
            href="https://search.cloud.commerce.tn.gov"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">verify here</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>PA Master Electrician License</h3>
        <p>
          Licensed in various PA jurisdictions as a Master Electrician since
          2023.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>PA HIC License</h3>
        <p>
          Licensed statewide in PA as a Home Improvement Contractor (HIC) since
          2020. License #164436, <a
            href="https://hicsearch.attorneygeneral.gov/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">verify here.</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>B.S. Robotics Engineering</h3>
        <p>
          Widener University, 2023 - team lead on a senior project awarded Best
          Oral Presentation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>OSHA 10</h3>
        <p>Certified in OSHA's 10-hour construction industry safety program.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>NFPA 70E</h3>
        <p>
          Certified in NFPA 70E electrical safety standards for safe work
          practices around live electrical systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
